            Kod pocztowy (in "Adres korespondencyjny" data group) - can be found at [Zarządzanie polami](https://app.bergsystem.pl/userdatashow/2).
          example: 07-524
        officeCity:
          type: string
          description: |
            Miasto (in "Adres biura" data group) - can be found at [Zarządzanie polami](https://app.bergsystem.pl/userdatashow/2).
          example: Poznan
        officeStreet:
          type: string
          description: |
            Ulica (in "Adres biura" data group) - can be found at [Zarządzanie polami](https://app.bergsystem.pl/userdatashow/2).
          example: Cisowa
        officeHouseNumber:
          type: string
          description: |
            Numer domu (in "Adres biura" data group) - can be found at [Zarządzanie polami](https://app.bergsystem.pl/userdatashow/2).
          example: 32A
        officePremisesNumber:
          type: string
